KrKr2 distribution terms
========================

The AdvancedAppCreator KrKr2 application is distributed as a combined work
under the GNU General Public License version 2 or, at your option, any later
version (GPL-2.0-or-later). The complete license text is in
LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt.

This GPL election covers the fork-owned modifications and the application as a
combined work. It does not erase copyright notices or replace the compatible
terms that apply to individual third-party components:

1. The KiriKiri/Kirikiri Z-derived runtime retains the permissive terms and
   notices reproduced in LICENSE.
2. cpp/core/movie/ffmpeg/Geometry.h and RenderFormats.h are
   GPL-2.0-or-later.
3. cpp/core/movie/ffmpeg/RenderFlags.cpp is LGPL-2.1-or-later.
4. Other embedded code, assets, generated dependency packages, and Java
   archives retain their own terms. See LICENSE, LICENSES/, source headers,
   vcpkg-installed copyright files, and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Distributors of application binaries must provide the complete corresponding
source, build scripts, license text, and notices required by the GPL.
LGPL-covered components additionally require the applicable source and
relinking or replacement rights. The currently verified Android FFmpeg builds
are statically linked; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the target-by-target
evidence and corresponding relinking-material requirement.

The direct UnRAR dependency is removed. Restricted 7-Zip RAR decoder sources
are excluded from the application build and installed dependency payload. RAR
extraction uses libarchive.

This guide is informational and does not replace any license text.
